# Sithara Marina frontend — environment template (documentation only; Next.js
# does not load this file). Copy it to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in the
# values. In deployed environments, set the same variables in the platform's
# environment settings.
#
# WARNING: every `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variable is inlined into the browser bundle
# at BUILD time. Never put secrets, API keys or tokens in them. A production
# build fails if a required variable is missing or invalid.

# Base URL of the backend API (absolute URL, no trailing slash, no /api prefix),
# used by the user and admin areas. Its CORS policy must allow the frontend
# origin. API docs: https://sithara-backend.onrender.com/docs
#
# Local backend: http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://sithara-backend.onrender.com
